WHAT THE FORK ADDS
------------------

All Android-specific work in this repository is by @SehonYT unless otherwise
noted. It covers:

  * Build support for every Android ABI: armv7-linux-androideabi,
    aarch64-linux-android, i686-linux-android, x86_64-linux-android.
  * Removal of dependencies with no Android support (aws-lc-sys, onig_sys,
    openssl-sys via native-tls, arboard).
  * crates/jcode-clipboard - a new pure-Rust clipboard implementation, because
    arboard excludes Android in its own source.
  * Re-enabling the QuickJS/codemode sandbox on Android via rquickjs-sys'
    "bindgen" feature.
  * Mobile hardening (bounded reads, subprocess timeouts).
  * tests/mobile/ - an adversarial test suite for phone failure modes.
  * .github/workflows/termux-armv7.yml - the four-ABI build CI.
  * docs/android/ - port documentation.


WHAT REMAINS UPSTREAM'S WORK
-----------------------------

Essentially all of jcode: the agent, the TUI, the harness, the provider
integrations, the swarm, and the upstream documentation. Credit belongs to the
upstream authors. Please report non-Android issues upstream.


